sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User
    participant PaymentService as PaymentService
    participant BankGateway as BankGateway
    participant NotificationService as NotificationService
    actor Admin as Admin
    participant ReportService as ReportService
    participant DatabaseService as DatabaseService
    participant CacheService as CacheService
    Note over User,CacheService: Payment Processing with Proper Return Flow
    User->>PaymentService: submits payment request
    PaymentService->>PaymentService: validates payment data
    PaymentService->>BankGateway: process payment
    BankGateway-->>PaymentService: returns payment result
    PaymentService->>NotificationService: send confirmation
    NotificationService-->>PaymentService: returns delivery status
    PaymentService-->>User: returns final confirmation
    Note over User,CacheService: Nested Call Chain
    Admin->>ReportService: requests report
    ReportService->>DatabaseService: data
    DatabaseService->>CacheService: check cache
    CacheService-->>DatabaseService: returns cache miss
    DatabaseService->>DatabaseService: queries main database
    DatabaseService-->>ReportService: returns report data
    ReportService->>ReportService: formats the data
    ReportService-->>Admin: returns formatted report
